MIT License — EvoMem-Enterprise benchmark data

This file covers the generated benchmark data distributed with this repository,
which the software license in LICENSE does not itself name. The terms are the
same MIT terms; only the subject matter differs.

Scope: everything under `data/` — the frozen EvoMem-Enterprise pilot world and
all fifteen multiworld worlds, including their configuration, ontology, policy,
workflow, and schema files, generated assertion events, tasks, and gold labels —
together with the recorded evaluation outputs under `experiments/`.

All of this material is synthetic. It is produced by
`scripts/generate_evomem_enterprise.py` from fixed seeds and contains no real
customer, personal, or proprietary data.

